      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/06/smoked-salmon-goat-cheese-bites-step2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cut the stems off the bottom of the radicchio. Carefully peel apart the leaves into separate small leaves for serving, saving any leftover radicchio for other salads or recipes. Wash the leaves and pat dry.",
